Subject: [PATCH 1/2] carrousel: PORTRAIT_MOVE_TO_BLASON turns the portrait
 into the blason

Copies the portrait to the blason, moves the portrait to saved and, in
the misc notes of the blason_notes_dir folder (default Blasons), rewrites
the m=IM references to the person into m=FIM ones.
